  <para style="h">Feilibi Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Feilibi Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Feilibi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flb</para>
  <para style="mt">Feilibi Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni hoji <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ghala <char style="png">Feilibi</char>de sousan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miendedu soyuji shentu, lindao, gonjialade xin huaizho. <verse eid="PHP 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Mai ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Feilibini Shentulade Onxian Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Bi niefanie tai sumulakude bi zunjisan Hudade mafan kieliezho. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Bayasuku zhugheghala ta dajialade oluzhi izhi onxian giezho. <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>Ingiekushi ta kaishi giesan hhe uduse eli kutula gouxioxii chonjizhi hhantu wilie giezho. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Tai dunda gou wilieni kaishi giesan hhe ene wilieni <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani udu kuzhese onchen giekui bi hende xianxin giezho. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Bi ingiezhi tai man sumulase indanji wo, ta mii zhughede wine. Bi bafanzi soukude, pse gouxioxide oluzhi huizhi ganzhen beikude Huda made ogisan nenjiende ta man hhantulazho. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Bi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i zhugheghala tai matugie sanasanyi Huda made ganzhen beine. <verse eid="PHP 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Bi onxian giese tai oreku erlinji pandon gieku jiere yebeiye olodo, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>yanshi zui gouni bikui fenjizhi Mexiha ireku udude ganjin, yama ulie sugieghachen kun danla, <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani kouizhi gou wilielai olon giedene kuaiku, zanjikuni Hudade ogi giezho.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexihade Oluzhi Amitura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Gaijiula, made penjisan shiqin kharei gouxioxii ondaghasanyi bi tande mejieghaku duran wine. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Bi Mexihade oluzhi bafanzi sousei hongunni soyuji budui, psedu kunla man mejiewo. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Mii bareise dabufun gaijiula Ezhanyi goude xianxin giedene goujida ulie ayizhi danzine fugiedagha Hudai daolii chonjizho.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Niezhanla dubiliezhi zhenjinduzhi chonjizho, da niezhanla gou zhugheghala Mexihai chonjizho. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Enezighan kunla Huda mii nanpei giezhi gouxioxii huighasei mejiedene oreku zhugheghala giezho. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Hhezighan kunla Mexihai chonjise zinie goyadene oluzhi shixinji ese giezho. Mujishi bi bafanzi soukude olon shouku gieghane giezho. <verse eid="PHP 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Ingieseye yan xiangan wo? Huai mujiye oluzho, gou mujiye oluzho, yan gieliuzhe Mexihani chonji keighase bi bayasuzho. Bi pse bayasukushi <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>tai onxian gieku, pse <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani ruhherni banman giekui tungo giezhi mii andaghakui bi mejiene. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Bi hende panjizhi xiwon giesanshi mii yan shiqindeliuzhe ulie shizheghazhi eqighanku mutun edeye danzine fugiedaghazhi fugu amituliuzhe mii jiere Mexihani zhiguishighakui wo. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Mii kieliese bi amitushi Mexihade oluzho, fuguseye haochu wine. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Ingieliuzhe bi amiturazhi wilie giezhi jiego goushi bi alinie sunghukui ulie mejiene. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Ghuala mii jiai beizho. Bi duyase likai giezhi Mexihaghala hhantulaku duran wine. Enense pse gouni uwoma, <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>bi tande oluzhi duyade biku genjia biyo wine. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Bi ingiezhi hende xianxin giese duyade feiliezhi tanre man hhantu soukui mejiene. Ingiese tai xinyan jiere hendazhi bayasukui wine. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Ingie bi tai hhende pse echikude mii tungo giezhi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> giesan shiqinde kuaikui genjia olodoghane.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Zhunyonishi tashi asiman gojiani kun wo giezhi tai giekula Mexihani gouxioxi mutun izhishi. Ingiese bi tai uzhele irenu, ulie ireliuzhe tande nie muji bizhi beizhi undanladene gouxioxini xinyan fanmiende hhantu xiacha giezhi <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>tai fandui giesan kunlase goujida ulie ayikui bi mejiene. Ta ulie ayise hhelai widaku, pse tai jiuikui hhelade zhenmin giezho. Enelashi man Huda giesan wo. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Tande ogisan nenjienshi zinie Mexihai xianxin gieku pusho, hhende oluzhi shouku giekuye enbene. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Ta eghindusan zhanshi bi eghindusanghala niekielien wo. Eqighandei ta mii jiere chujieghezhi daozho, ede bi eghindusei ta chenliezho.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mexiha Mutun Goyane Meilade Uzhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Ingiese Mexihai miende tande sughaku kielien, orezhi sidaghaku, Shenlinghala laiwon gieku, pse renyi, ubali xiiku bise <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>tai sumuladan nie gholuzhi nieniedene orezhi nie zhughe gholu. Ingiese bi hende bayasune. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Yan shiqinniliuzhe zinie goyadene oluzhi bu gie, minshenni tanxin bu gie, goyane meilade uzhezhi kunlai goyasene fugiede uzhe. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Zinie goyane shiqinni bu gui, kunlai shiqinniye gui.<verse eid="PHP 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Ta zhughene Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i zhughe mutun gholugha.<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Hhende Hudai yanzi winema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">goyane Hudaghala pindane giezhi xiacha ese giedene<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Kharei goyane yanyanjilai bendazhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">hojini yanzi gholuzhi kun mutun oluwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">Kunni yanzi mutun irese<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Goyane meilade uzhezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">fugutula shunjiwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">da shizijia jiere fuguwo.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Ingiese Huda hhei zui unduni gholughazhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">hhende yanyanji nierese fugie nierei ogiwo.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Ingie asiman jieredu, zemin jieredu, zemin douradu yanyanjila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">man <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni nierede xiutuliezhi<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>Jien kunlai amanla <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihashi Ezhan wo giezhi chenren giedene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">Huda Adade kuaikui ireghawo.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duyade Gon Fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Ingiese mii orentula, bi tanre hhantu bikude ta chan chenliesan mutun ede bi tai hhende uwokude genjia qingiezhi ayi pugharazhi tai jiuikui shiqinni xiacha giezhi chenjigha. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Tai sudoro wilie giezhi goya gou isine gieghane giezhi tande duranji gieku nenli ogisanshi Huda wo. <verse eid="PHP 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Ta yan shiqin gieliuzhe boxin bu kielie, bu jianjindu. <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>Tande yama kheilaku wizhi ganjintu kun gholu. Ta Hudade yama maobin witu kewosi danlazhi duyade doghun, wirulasan kunlai dunda gon fai. <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>Aminni daolii xienjizhi khizhegha. Ingiese bi Mexihani udude goyane belien ese holuzhi belien wilie ese giezho giezhi kuaine. <verse eid="PHP 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Bi tai xianxin giekude oluzhi goyane sidagha gieku teizi jiere mure danlaghazhi chusunne pojieliuzhe bayasuzhi da tanre hhantu bayasune. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Taye qingiezhi bayasu, da mare hhantu bayasu.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Qimotai Ibafuqighala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Bi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i kouizhi <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ni tai hhende ghujighande peizhi echighaye giezho. Tai qinkonlai mejiezhi bi zhughene nanranshighane giezho. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Mare hhantu tande shixinji gonxin giesan kun hhense chugo nieda uwo. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Psedu kunla man zinie goyane shiqinyi guine, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani shiqinyi ulie guine. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Ingieliuzhe <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ni kunyi ta mejiene. Hhe goya adane mutun mii uzhezhi mare hhantu gouxioxide oluzhi wilie giezho. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Ingiese bi goyane shiqinni jiegoi mejiese deigo hhei peizhi echighane giezho. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Ingie oloncha ulie beidene biye echikui Ezhanyi miende xianxin giezho.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Ingiezhoma, bi sumulase <char style="pn">Ibafuqi</char>ni tai hhende khareizhi echighaku biyo wine giezho. Hheshi mii gaijiu, lienshou, mare hhantu zhan eghindusan kun wo. Ta hhei peizhi bi xiyo bikude banman gieghale irezho. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Hhe ta dajialai hende sanazhi, da hhe giemeresei ta mejiese hhe hende nango giezho. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Shuhua hhe giemerezhi fugukude kuruwoma, ingieliuzhe Huda hhende ubali xiizhi madeye ubali xiizho. Pse bi genjia yuchou giene. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Ingiese bi genjia jindazhi hhei peizhi echighaye. Ta hhei chanlase bayasune, mii yuchou giekuye choghonshine. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Ta Ezhanyi miende hende bayasuzhi hhei jienlie. Imutu kunlai zunzhun gie. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Ta made banman gie dasande hhe banman giezhi Mexihai wiliede oluzhi chabudu aminni widawo.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Zui Zhunyonishi Mexihani Taniku Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Mini gaijiula, zuihoude kielieye, ta Ezhanni miende bayasu. Bi xianxianji kielienyi pse huaise chijia uwo, tande haochu wine.<verse eid="PHP 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Ta hhezighan doghunni giesan kunlai fangula. Hhela nogheini xianli, beyene otolusan kun wo. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Zhenzhenji hetoune giesanlashi matan enezighan Hudai Ruhherde kouizhi libai giesanla wo, Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i kuaizho, beyede ese kouizho. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Biye beyede koui shidane. Kunla sumulase beyede kouine giese bi genjia ingiezhi gie shidane. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Mii oluzhi neimudude hetoune giewo. Bishi <char style="png">Isilie</char> minzu, <char style="pn">Bienyamin</char> painughun wo. Zhenzhenji <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kun wo. Guijinghala kieliese bishi Falisai kun wo. <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Rexinni kieliese bi jiohuini heizhi daozho. Guijinni yoqiughala kieliese made yama kheilakui uwo. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Ingieliuzhe eqighandei made gouni wo giesanlai ede bi Mexihani yenyinghala man gou wini danlaghazho. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Zinie ene pusho, bi soyujilai gou wini danlaghakushi bi zunjisan Ezhan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni tanikui zui zhunyoni danlaghazho. Bi hhende oluzhi soyujilane bendazhi hhagha mutun uzhekushi Mexihani goyadene ireghazhi <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>hhere hhantulane giezho. Made bisan gounishi guijinse iresan pusho, bi Mexihani xianxin giekughala Huda ogisan wo. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Bi Mexihani tanizhi hhei aminne olusan nenlii mejieku duran wine. Pse hhere hhantu ku shouizhi hhei fugukui daghaku duran wine. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Ingie bi fugusanse aminne oluse giezho.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mubiode Daine Giezhi Holu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Eneshi bi ijin chengun oluwo, ijin onqienshiwo giesan pusho. Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> made agighasanyi bi agine giezhi izhi holuzho. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Gaijiula, bi goyane agiwo giezhi ulie sumulane. Bi zinie nie shiqin giezho, daosan shiqinyi matadene meliedekui agine giezhi <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>mubiode daine giezhi holuzho. Ingie Huda Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende mii urudene ogine giesan asiman jieredu jianlini linlane giezho. <verse eid="PHP 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Ingiese matanyi dundadu hen kunla man ingiezhi sumulakui wo. Tande buxiantu xianfa bise Huda eneiye tande mejieghane. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Matan yan chendude kuruse zhao ene chenduzhe gieye.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Gaijiula, ta man mii daghazhi suru. Pse bijien tande surughasan yanzii daghazhi giesan hhezighan kunlai ta goude uzhe. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Bi chan tande kieliezho, ede pse wilazhi kielieye, olon kunla Mexihani shizijiai duitou mutun giezho. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Hhelani jiegoshi widakuni wo. Hhelani hudashi goyani kieli wo. Hhela goya shizhekune ulie mejiedene kuaine, sumulasanlashi duyani shiqin wo. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Matanshi asiman gojiani kun wo, hhense nie jiuichen irekui sagheizho. Hheshijiu Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha wo. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Hhe yanyanjii goyadene shunjighasan fugie nenlighala matanyi bixin beyeni goya famatu beyene mutun niekielien gholughane.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Ingiese bi orezhi sanasan gaijiula, tashi mii bayasuku wo, mii mienzi wo. Bi oresanla, ta Ezhanni kouizhi beizhi undanla.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sughaku Kielien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Bi <char style="pn">Yuyajie</char>de xiahua gieye, pse <char style="pn">Xinduji</char>de xiahua gieye, ta ghuala Ezhanni miende tonjie gie. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Mii zhenzhenji gou lienshou, bi chiiye xiahua gieye. Chi ene funilade banman gie. Hhela gouxioxini wiliede mare, pse <char style="pn">Gelimien</char>, psedu lienshoulare hhantu khishulazhi daozho. Hhelai nierei aminni jilasan benzi jiere huaizho.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Ta Ezhanni miende chan bayasu. Bi pse kielieye, ta bayasu. <verse eid="PHP 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Jien kunlade renyine mejiegha. Ezhan chadashiwo. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Yamade munan bu giezhi yan shiqindeliuzhe onxian gie, xiahua giezhi kere, mafan gieku zhugheghala ta keresanlane Hudade kielie. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Ingiese kun lijie gie daku Hudai pinnan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i sudoro tai zhughe, sumulakui baohu giene.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Gaijiula, zuihoude kielieye, ta chan zui gouni, kunla kuaikui sumula. Jien zhenni, zunjiku, gundanni, ganjinni, oreku, gou minshen enelai sumula. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Ta mase surusan, jienliesan, chenliesan, chanlasanlai izhigie gie. Ingiese pinnantu Huda tanre hhantu wo.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feilibi Kunlai Murede Baolo Mafan Kieliezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Bi Ezhanni miende hende bayasukushi ta mii zhaogu giekui ede pse jila irewo. Shijishan ta izhi mii zhaogu giene giezhoma jihui ese irezho. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Bi ingiezhi kieliekushi made yama chaisan pusho. Bi yan qinkondeliuzhe zhigan giekui suruwo. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Bi nanxinde matugie giekui mejiene, bayande matugie giekuiye mejiene. Chuduku, oliesuku, bayanni, chaiku, yan shiqin yan qinkondeliuzhe matugie gieku banfai bi suruwo. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Made lilian ogisan hhende kouizhi bi yanniliuzhe gie shidane. <verse eid="PHP 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Ingiezhoma, bi kunnan bikude ta mare hhantu danjizho, ingiese gou wo.<verse eid="PHP 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>
    <char style="png">Feilibi</char> kunla, bi gouxioxi chonjizhi qiizhi <char style="png">Maqidun</char>se likai giekude baer ogiku shiqin jiere tanse chugo psedu jiohuila mare hhantu ese danjisanyi taye mejiene. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Bi <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char>de bikude ta touchan erchanji bi injikulai ta khughozhi ireghawo. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Bi tanse mure kerene gie ese giezho. Zinie ta giesan wiliede haochu olodoghane giezho. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Made yanyanji wine, da feiliezho. Ta <char style="pn">Ibafuqi</char>i tungo giezhi made khughosanlai bi jienliedene kuruzho. Eneshi Huda bayasuzhi jienlieku andatu mure wo. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Bi zunjisan Huda famatu bayansene Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende tai yanyanji injikulai ogizhi kurughane. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Matanyi ada Hudade chanqi izhi kuaikui ogi. Amine!<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihoude Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miendedu jien shentulade kielien asa. Mare hhantuku gaijiula tande kielien asazho. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Shentula man, tebieshi <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> hongunni kunla tande kielien asazho. <verse eid="PHP 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani nenjien tai zhughede bi gie!<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
